ror stories about Paradox messing with M20 supplements. <br /> <br /> Yet.</div> </div> </div> </div>Phil has a few regarding the books he wrote for M20, but they're more in terms of things he wasn't allowed to fix I believe.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Damian May","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar479_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-27T04:59:07-08:00","id":1437227,"title":"","content":"I'd love to see a revival of the Tales of Magic series covering how to retool the game for deferment genres of fiction. Renewing the Dead Magic series to cover the mystic lore of different cultures and time periods would be grand too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-27T08:21:18-08:00","id":1437236,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Astromancer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1434206-it-seems-m20-will-continue-a-while-before-m5-drops?p=1437227#post1437227\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-ri