er b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1434206-it-seems-m20-will-continue-a-while-before-m5-drops?p=1437091#post1437091\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't M5 can drop. Mage just doesn't fit the 5th edition paradigm we've seen so far. Hell, I'm skeptical about W5, nevermind M5.</div> </div> </div> </div>I hear bad things about V5","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26433-ascentionthemage","name":"AscentionTheMage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26433_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"110"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-23T01:47:46-07:00","id":1441039,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AscentionTheMage</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1434206-it-seems-m20-will-continue-a-while-before-m5-drops?p=1441036#post1441036\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I hear bad things about V5</div> </div> </div> </div>Which are all totally hearsay and wrong. V5 is brilliant. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Anyway, I had previously thought that it was unlikely that WW/Paradox would do M5 anytime soon, for three good reasons:<br /> <br /> 1) They are still busy trying to fully establish what they are doing with V5, and have yet to do anything with W5.<br /> 2) The M20 line is still selling books and maintaining the IP. It would be a mistake to sacrifice anything without an clear notion of what you will replace it with.<br /> 3) Mage and Vampire, in their original forms, never really meshed conceptually in the same setting. Mage could easily be entirely independent of the other WoD game lines and it would barely affect the game itself, which has plenty of other antagonists to work with.<br /> <br /> For me, Mage20 has difficulties of being too big as it stands, which might be a reason to make a new concise edition. Otherwise, it is sensible to keep the status quo and develop it as it is. With a Wraith electronic game on the horizon, I honestly wonder whether it would be best to skip Mage entirely and go straight to a new version of Wraith instead?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2517,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2517-trippy","user":"Trippy","date":". 03-23-2021, 05:33 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2517-trippy","name":"Trippy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2517_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1018"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-23T02:04:27-07:00","id":1441044,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"htt